<h1>📚 Beginner Coding Glossary</h1>

<dl>

<dt><strong>Variable</strong></dt>
<dd>A named storage location for data.</dd>

<dt><strong>Function</strong></dt>
<dd>A reusable block of instructions.</dd>

<dt><strong>Loop</strong></dt>
<dd>Repeats instructions.</dd>

<dt><strong>Bug</strong></dt>
<dd>An error in a program.</dd>

<dt><strong>Compiler</strong></dt>
<dd>Converts source code into another form that can be executed.</dd>

</dl>

